sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant SPA as React SPA
  participant API as Django API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Mail as SendGrid/Brevo/console

  User->>SPA: Submit signup
  SPA->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register/
  API->>DB: Validate and create User/preferences/audit
  API->>Mail: Render and send verification email synchronously
  Mail-->>API: Provider result or fallback result
  API-->>SPA: Registration response; no JWT yet

  User->>SPA: Submit verification code
  SPA->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/verify-email/
  API->>DB: Mark email verified
  API-->>SPA: Access and refresh JWT pair

  User->>SPA: Login
  SPA->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login/
  API->>DB: Authenticate user
  API-->>SPA: Access and refresh JWT pair

  User->>SPA: Open protected page
  SPA->>API: HTTPS request with Authorization: Bearer access
  API->>DB: Resolve user and execute view
  API-->>SPA: Protected response

  SPA->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh/ with refresh token
  API->>DB: Rotate token and blacklist old token
  API-->>SPA: New access and refresh pair
  Note over SPA: Source client stores new access token but does not persist rotated refresh token.

  SPA->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/logout/
  API-->>SPA: 404; no backend logout route is registered
  Note over SPA,API: Client clears local state. Server-side logout revocation is not implemented by this route.
  Note over SPA,API: No terms/privacy acceptance gate is present in registration, login or protected request path.
